  "story": "Early Beatlemania: bright, bouncy, slightly hairy clean chime cut live in a few takes. We approximate the guitar-and-amp combo (rather than modeling one specific guitar) with the VOX_TOPBOOST voicing pushed just into its earliest breakup, plus a light compressor to even out pick attack. Listen for how the top end sparkles and bounces rather than sounding smooth or scooped.",
